<title>USA: Zapata to redeem convertible preferred shrs.</title>
<headline>Zapata to redeem convertible preferred shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zapata Corp said Tuesday it will redeem all of the 2,627 outstanding shares of its $2 noncumulative convertible preference stock.</p>
<p>It is to pay a redemption price of $80 per share. A redemption date has not been announced, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
